# Intentionally empty: this file exists so that it ignores nothing.
#
# `.prettierignore` (and, since Prettier 3, `.gitignore`) both exclude `/.aidd/`, which is correct
# for `bun run format` — agent-written artifacts are not the repository's to reformat wholesale.
# The side effect is that any targeted `prettier --check ".aidd/features/*/feature.json"` matches
# zero files and reports success without examining anything.
#
# `scripts/check-aidd-format.ts` passes `--ignore-path scripts/aidd-prettierignore` so Prettier
# uses this file *instead of* those two, and therefore actually reads the metadata it was handed.
#
# Do not add patterns here. Adding one would silently shrink the set of `.aidd` metadata files the
# gate examines, which is the exact vacuous pass the gate exists to prevent.
